OL,3,ACass report author says she does not
OL,4,Asupport draft conversion practices bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe author of the independent review
OL,7,Finto gender identity services for young
OL,8,Fpeople says she doesn't support the
OL,9,Fcurrent draft bill banning conversion
OL,10,Fpractices - having previously welcomed
OL,11,Fit.
OL,13,FBaroness Cass said the current wording
OL,14,Fof the bill risked "serious unintended
OL,15,Fconsequences" for parents of children
OL,16,Fsuffering gender distress, or medical
OL,17,Fprofessionals working in that area.
OL,19,FShe was speaking at a parliamentary
OL,20,Fcommittee scrutinising the bill, which
OL,21,Fthe government said would protect LGBT
OL,22,Fpeople in England and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
