OL,3,ACass report author says she does not
OL,4,Asupport draft conversion practices bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said they
OL,7,Fwelcomed her comments and would take
OL,8,Fall evidence put forward by the
OL,9,Fcommittee seriously as they "want to
OL,10,Fget this ban right".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
