OL,3,AFive EU countries announce migrant
OL,4,Adeportation centre in Rwanda
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive EU countries will open a migrant
OL,7,Fdeportation centre in Rwanda next year
OL,8,Fas part of a broader push to boost
OL,9,Fremovals.
OL,11,FGermany, Denmark, Austria, Greece and
OL,12,Fthe Netherlands are expected to open a
OL,13,F"return hub" ready to accept transfers
OL,14,Fin 2027, the Dutch and Danish
OL,15,Fgovernments announced in statements.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
