OL,3,ANvidia dismisses 'Bring Jensen Back'
OL,4,Acampaign as Trump backs effort to
OL,5,Areinstate ex CEO
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the BBC has been told the board of
OL,8,Fthe AI chip giant is not interested in
OL,9,Freinstating him after he resigned last
OL,10,Fweek following revelations he had two
OL,11,Faffairs, including one that involved a
OL,12,Fsuspected Chinese spy.
OL,14,FThe same day, the White House also said
OL,15,Fit will further restrict China's access
OL,16,Fto AI chips from firms like Nvidia.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
